# ReviewNatin design & skills

## Required skills (read before UI work)

When building or styling **mobile** (`apps/mobile`):

- `.cursor/skills/reviewnatin-mobile-design` — brand UI, AppLogo, icons, gradients, onboarding patterns
- `mobile-design-system` (~/.agents/skills/) — touch targets, spacing grid, accessibility
- `building-native-ui` (~/.agents/skills/) — Expo Router, ScrollView + safe areas, components outside `app/`

When building **marketing/admin web**:

- `frontend-design` (~/.claude/skills/) — distinctive layout, not generic purple-gradient SaaS

## Brand (do not drift)

- **Source:** Claude Design handoff — `reviewnatin-ph/project/screens.jsx` (RN palette)
- **Tone:** Filipino exam prep — royal blue `#0B5FFF`, navy `#08245C`, gold `#FFC928`
- **Font:** Plus Jakarta Sans only (800 display, 700 labels, 500 body)
- **Logo:** `LogoMark` + `BrandWordmark` — Review**Natin** gold accent on "Natin"
- **App icon:** `assets/brand/icon.svg` → run `npm run generate-icons` in `apps/mobile`
- **Headers:** `LinearGradient` hero with rounded bottom corners (28px)
- **Cards:** white, 18–22px radius, soft navy shadow
- **Tab bar:** Home · Review · Stats · Profile with top active indicator bar

## Expo constraints

- Target **Expo SDK 56** with Expo Go from https://expo.dev/go (not Play Store SDK 54)
- Never run `npm audit fix --force` in this monorepo

## Code layout

- Routes: `apps/mobile/app/`
- UI + logic: `apps/mobile/components/`, `lib/`, `providers/`
- Shared exam slugs: `@reviewnatin/shared`
